"<strong>WCPOS</strong> requires <a href=\"%1$s\">WooCommerce %2$s or higher</a>. Please <a href=\"%3$s\">install and activate WooCommerce</a>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>WCPOS</strong> vereist <a href=\"%1$s\">WooCommerce %2$s of hoger</a>. Installeer en activeer alstublieft <a href=\"%3$s\">WooCommerce</a>"

